{"5082920":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Traceroute","steam_appid":5082920,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"dlc":[5152640],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Game Overview<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A network-building simulation where you design your own communication network by directly wiring routers and cables. Manage bandwidth and latency on a limited budget, and make sure data reaches every user safely, from server to endpoint.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The joy of connecting<\/strong> — Draw cables across the grid and route data through routers, splitters, and mergers to design the optimal path<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A living network<\/strong> — Latency and overload play out in real time as traffic builds up<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Threats without warning<\/strong> — Weather sudden DDoS attacks and traffic surges that test your network's resilience<\/p><\/li><\/ul>","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Game Overview<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A network-building simulation where you design your own communication network by directly wiring routers and cables. Manage bandwidth and latency on a limited budget, and make sure data reaches every user safely, from server to endpoint.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The joy of connecting<\/strong> — Draw cables across the grid and route data through routers, splitters, and mergers to design the optimal path<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A living network<\/strong> — Latency and overload play out in real time as traffic builds up<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Threats without warning<\/strong> — Weather sudden DDoS attacks and traffic surges that test your network's resilience<\/p><\/li><\/ul>","short_description":"A network-building simulation across the cities of a nation. Lay routers and cables to design your network, balancing bandwidth and latency on a limited budget. Survive sudden traffic surges and DDoS attacks as you connect city after city, learning real networking concepts as you play.","supported_languages":"English<strong>*<\/strong>, Korean<strong>*<\/strong><br><strong>*<\/strong>languages with full audio support","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5082920\/34826f3703b84d4940fd6f5babe79a55d53e0495\/header.jpg?t=1793707709","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5082920\/e3419015cd24788a574c78092f5e35a6e17307d2\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793707709","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5082920\/e3419015cd24788a574c78092f5e35a6e17307d2\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793707709","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Core i3 이상 \/ 듀얼 코어 2.0GHz 이상<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Intel HD Graphics 620 이상 (DirectX 11 지원)<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Network:<\/strong> Broadband Internet connection<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 400 MB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Sound Card:<\/strong> DirectX 호환 사운드 카드<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10\/11 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i5 이상<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1050 이상 (VRAM 2GB+)<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Network:<\/